%% System Data Flow
flowchart LR
Actors[Users] --> Web[React]
Web -->|validated request| API[Spring API]
API -->|authorize + business rules| Domain[Domain services]
Domain <-->|operational CRUD| DB[(PostgreSQL)]
Domain -->|selected event only| Adapter[Blockchain adapter]
Adapter -->|tx and receipt| Chain[Smart contract]
Chain -->|event + tx hash| Adapter
Adapter -->|status metadata| DB
DB -->|authorized query results| API
API --> Web
